[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n5_ranulf"
text = "# DRAFT
# Ranulf at dusk, filling the censers in the choir (night 5, clear and cold). Smooth. (He wears the horned costume.)
# The abbot sick from the smoke; where Ranulf was when Thomas was \"attacked\" (Suspicion +5); and, if the porter has
# heard from Kit tonight that he bought no candles (lane_kit_5), the wrong question (Suspicion +10): we have all we need.
== start
(Ranulf is filling the censers from his leather bag. The church already smells of it, though Matins is hours off.)
Ranulf: Porter. Early again. You've made a habit of it.
-> topics

== again
(He hangs a censer on its hook and reaches for the next.)
Ranulf: Porter.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n5_ranulf_abbot] (Say the abbot can hardly breathe for the smoke.) -> abbot
* [if not n5_ranulf_where] (Ask where he was when Thomas was attacked.) -> where
* [if lane_kit_5] [if not n5_ranulf_candles] (Say Kit told you he bought no candles today.) -> candles

== abbot [set n5_ranulf_abbot]
Ranulf: Then he should breathe deeper. It works on what's in the chest as well as what's in the house.
Ranulf: Father Abbot ordered it. I only burn it.
-> topics

# The wrong question to the wrong brother (design doc): Suspicion +5.
== where [set n5_ranulf_where] [suspicion 5]
Ranulf: Here, at my candles, as I am every evening at that hour. I heard the cry, like everyone.
(He doesn't blink.)
Ranulf: And you, porter? Thomas says you were first through the door. You generally are.
-> topics

# The wrong question to the wrong brother (design doc): Suspicion +10.
== candles [set n5_ranulf_candles] [suspicion 10]
(He stops with a censer in his hand.)
Ranulf: Kit should mind her tray.
Ranulf: We have all we need now, porter. That's all.
-> topics

== leave
Ranulf: In the choir tonight, porter. Breathe deep.
"
